{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Rudy\n🦌 Father of Noelle and Dess, husband of Carol; bedridden in Hometown's hospital.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Rudy_Overworld_1.png","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":94,"height":190},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Carol**\nHis wife. They met when he told her she was \"a piece of woman who WAS ON FIRE\" [TODO: verify exact EN quote] — she responded with a slap that knocked him out, and they still ended up getting married and having Dess and Noelle.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Noelle and Dess**\nFather of both. Very protective of Noelle, supports her interest in Susie, and keeps an angel doll they made together as kids as a good-luck charm.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Asgore**\nOld college friend; Asgore visits him often at the hospital, brings him roses, and includes him in his prayers.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Toriel**\nHe also met her in college, and remembers her as much wilder and more energetic in her youth than the Toriel of today.","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**The fifth to \"disappear\" (from a scene)**\nIn Tenna's flashback, each Holiday disappears from that scene one by one — Rudy the fifth, coinciding with him having \"fallen\" (his hospitalization). He doesn't actually disappear from the rest of the game.","x":-680,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Is Rudy the Roaring Knight?**\nA fan theory that's fairly debated outside this vault too: a clear motive (searching for Dess, just like the Knight seeks to create Fountains), the antlers' link to the Holiday family, and the fact that he doesn't recognize Susie in Ch.4's Weird Route while still recognizing Kris normally. Several supporting arguments (wordplay, the dominant hand never shown) are much weaker. [[Roaring Knight]]","x":-680,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"3"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Carol_Holiday.webp","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":83,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":90,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Asgore_Dreemurr_overworld.webp","x":420,"y":10,"width":127,"height":180},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Toriel_Overworld.webp","x":-130,"y":270,"width":91,"height":180},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/TheRoaringKnightDeltarune.webp","x":-974,"y":-313,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","x":-1010,"y":190,"width":280,"height":176,"file":"Sprites/The_Dreemurrs_and_Holiday_Families.webp"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","x":-680,"y":-560,"width":280,"height":220,"color":"3","text":"**Ch.4 Weird Route — doesn't recognize Susie**\nIn the Weird Route, Rudy irritably asks Kris, \"why the hell did you bring your friend here?\" [TODO: verify exact EN quote] upon seeing Susie, as if he doesn't recognize her at all -- one of the most direct pieces of evidence for the Knight theory."},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","x":-1010,"y":-590,"width":280,"height":210,"file":"Sprites/Rudy_weird_route_dont_knows_sussie.png"},{"id":"s7","type":"text","x":-1330,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"3","text":"**The echo with Flowery**\nRudy tells Kris \"you've grown so much\" [TODO: verify exact EN quote] in that same scene -- almost the same phrase Flowery greets Kris with at the start of Ch.5 (\"You've grown so much, haven't you?\"). Basis for the Rudy-Flowery-Knight parallel that circulates in the community. [[Flowery]]"},{"id":"s7-img","type":"file","x":-1660,"y":-290,"width":280,"height":210,"file":"Sprites/flowery_rudy_same_dialogue.png"}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e4_x0","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e5_x0","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s5-img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s4img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s6","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s6img","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s6","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"cross_s6_s5","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s7","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s7","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s7img","fromNode":"s7-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s7","toSide":"left","color":"6"}]}